As suggested by the LaTeXV3-VT15-Working-Group, \language=0 could be
reserved to an empty default language, letting the installation to define
its own default language. This would oblige documents arriving with any
other default language to be slightly modified with something like Sebastian
said. Please have a look at the document published in the archives for
any further argumentation.

